Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Beyond Redemption
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 23
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where would Cha Erlang keep the antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Something so precious…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,he wouldn’t carry it on him, would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, why are you so absent-minded?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, if we accidentally get hit by the Boss’s miasma,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,what should we do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve never been afflicted by it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but a companion of ours once accidentally breathed in the miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You could ask him about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right—he would definitely know about the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t be walking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust Wolffy will bring the antidote soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid I can’t wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have another way; come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,To what do I owe the pleasure of this visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your face is drained of color and your eyes look listless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the rumors are true; you’ve been afflicted by a potent miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the chatter—how can this miasma be cured?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It can’t be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one method I could try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious century eggs, mysterious tears…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,…and a smile full of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.23,0:02:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is one ingredient in particular that is truly unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.95,0:02:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A sandshark’s reverse scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A sandshark?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that quite common?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, but as for the reverse scale…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the Golden Sandshark has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we trust what he says?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have indeed heard before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,that the Golden Sandshark’s reverse scale has miraculous properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But those sandsharks are incredibly ferocious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, it has to be the {\i1}Golden{\i0} one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I give you two extra bottles of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard everything you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can supply the other ingredients for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you’ll have to get that reverse scale yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.23,0:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous; I’m not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Big Sister; you still have us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry back and report to Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you get hit by the miasma a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You should rest more if you’re not feeling well; I’ll help you with the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But the miasma was cleared up ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you cure it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where the antidote is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss provides it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to go and queue up to get it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the antidote is just being handed out like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.52,0:04:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss is worried that one of our own might accidentally get exposed to the miasma again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so he’s distributing the antidote now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a stroke of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you helping me with my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your own work yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot open your eyes for three days after taking the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you’ll go permanently blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.89,0:04:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a catch like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.61,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and take this to Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’ve got other things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, come into the cockpit with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re going into the cockpit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be able to see the map and find the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,let me handle such a tough job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a model worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go assemble those parts; we’ll need them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say we were going to the cockpit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The utility room next to the cockpit counts as part of the cockpit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t get away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Golden Sandshark right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there are so many small sandsharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In what way are they small?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that glowing reverse scale on its body?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.21,0:06:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay here and wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t get the reverse scale if we keep getting dragged along by the sandshark like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find a way to restrain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishy, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:07:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s something glowing in its gills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s a reverse scale. It’s like a bad tooth to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why it’s so agitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn’t mean to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Removing that reverse scale won’t be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re injured now; let me take the reverse scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let’s do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the sandsharks behind you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Its back is too slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I could have pulled them out with a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is Boss setting up such a huge cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you know? This cage is for catching Blue Scarf and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Boss found out Blue Scarf was looking for a sandshark’s reverse scale to make an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s waiting for Blue Scarf and the sandshark to wear each other out in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can swoop in and reap the rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie must be with her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there’s any news from the people Boss sent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you suddenly wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They’ve all gone into hiding; we can’t find where they are at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie, the sandshark is to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you could spot the sandshark’s trail like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyesight is excellent; I’ll help you keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out behind you, Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie, it’s up ahead to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:09:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the Golden Sandshark—watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be rash; let’s retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’re already here, there’s no need to rush off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’re already here, there’s no need to rush off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I’ll finish you off myself before the symptoms kick in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go retrieve the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, if we don’t leave now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sandshark is going to tear the vehicle apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf, we’ll settle our score another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, forget about the cage; let’s get out of here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang and the sandshark are both gone. Does that mean we’re safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get you treated for the miasma quickly…but how do we break the cage open?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, open the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the earlier battle cause the miasma to spread?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, hurry and bring the antidote over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I wasn’t feeling well, Mom used to hold me just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s…you.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
